id: lions-heart
name: Lion’s Heart
talentCategory: surge
prerequisites: Never Surrender
description: >
  You do not give up the fight until your final breath is drawn.
text: >
  Lion’s Heart: You do not give up the fight until your final breath is drawn.
  –Prerequisites: Never Surrender
  (1)-[Passive]: You may use the Surge Maneuver an additional time per Combat Encounter.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you take an amount of Damage that would reduce your Life Points to 0 or below, you may use the Surge Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you must use a Healing Surge.

---

[passive]
# (1)
surge.uses += 1;

# (2) Reduced to your minimum Life Points, chosen on the Defeated card - but not a Triggered/Defeated effect: the `lethal-damage`
# Moment, its 1/Encounter its own, the Keyword's one an Encounter neither spent nor needed (the user's). Never Automatic, it hands
# over an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver: the Surge Maneuver itself, its own limit spent, a Healing Surge (chat.mjs lionsHeart).
[triggered/lethal-damage, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 2]
lionsHeart();
